---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { approvedPublicContactEmail } from '../config/public-contact.mjs';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy notice" description="Information about data processing on the Visha Tech Picks pre-launch website.">
  <div class="content-container simple-page prose"><span class="eyebrow">Privacy first</span><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p class="intro">This notice describes the pre-launch static website. It must be reviewed before public deployment.</p><h2>What we collect</h2><p>The current site does not provide user accounts, checkout, newsletter subscription or a contact form. The in-page guide search runs locally in your browser and does not transmit search queries to a website backend.</p><h2>Hosting and technical logs</h2><p>When the site is eventually hosted, the hosting provider may process IP addresses, device information and technical access logs to serve pages and protect the service. Hosting configuration and actual processing must be verified at the public launch.</p><h2>Analytics and cookies</h2><p>No third-party analytics, advertising tracking pixels or marketing cookies are integrated into this pre-launch source. We will update this notice before enabling optional analytics or other tracking.</p><h2>External websites</h2><p>Links to third-party websites may lead to their own privacy policies. Amazon referral links are not active in this pre-launch build.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For privacy and editorial questions, email <a href={`mailto:${approvedPublicContactEmail}`}>{approvedPublicContactEmail}</a>. This notice must still be revised to reflect the actual hosting provider, retention and service configuration before public launch.</p></div>
</BaseLayout>
